Fixtures
--------

Replay fixtures under fixtures/ may contain payloads recorded from third-party applications,
sanitized. Where they do, the fixture directory carries its own NOTICE naming the upstream
project and its licence. In particular, fixtures recorded from the OpenTelemetry Demo
application (https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-demo) are derived from software
Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
